personality = "Tomas is a grizzled veteran farmer who has worked the land for sixty years. He knows every rock, every drainage pattern, every microclimate on the island. He speaks in weather proverbs and farming aphorisms. He's seen droughts, floods, blights, and bumper crops. He's gruff but deeply cares about passing on knowledge. He refuses to use modern tools, preferring his grandfather's hoe."
